msgid "Dodge Step"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.DS_MOD.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.DS_MOD.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Client-only automatic dodging for Shrouden.\n\nPortal summons: if you are in front of the boss within the configured range (default: 12 units), blink behind it.\nOptic blast: after the boss teleports into position, blink away within the configured distance (default: 7 units).\nIchor pursuit: when the boss turns into a puddle, blink away within the configured distance (default: 4.5 units).\n\nEach skill's trigger distance can be configured, or its dodging disabled.\n\nWortox uses Soul Hop first; otherwise, use a Lazy Explorer or an orange-gem King's Staff. Avoids dangerous landing spots and restores your previous weapon after dodging."
msgstr ""
